{
  "number": 1225,
  "title": "fix(ci): restore stable Flutter 3.50 compatibility",
  "body": "Flutter stable advanced to 3.50.0 (ab2912035e160d9cad6306df307576da6128ebdb) on 2026-11-11. PR #1224 Quality gate fails on 237 deprecated-member diagnostics for legacy Material/Cupertino imports, also present on its base 30912d93. This blocks the native fix #1213 and all subsequent code changes.\n\nScope: pubspec.yaml/lock direct standalone UI dependencies, tooling/brick/golden fixtures, migration guard compatibility and integration validation. Runtime, tests and documentation changes are split into per-epic child issues. Root implements serially with one active claim. Commits retain individual Refs; the coordinated PR merges only once all scopes pass together, because mixing legacy and standalone public UI types is unsafe. Ready child issues stay blocked and unassigned until integrated validation; no issue closes before merged evidence.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n1. Direct material_ui/cupertino_ui dependencies resolve from pub.dev with reviewed publisher/lock hashes; flutter pub get leaves tracked files unchanged under stable 3.50.\n2. Generated feature/template and strip fixtures use supported UI imports; text-literal and documentation guards still recognize the migrated source. All five actual Strip CI jobs succeed on the integrated head.\n3. Flutter 3.50 format, analyze and full host tests pass without suppressing deprecated-member diagnostics; current-head Quality gate and every other actual check succeed (or intentional manual platform skips).\n4. Fresh independent premerge review, merged-source parity, postmerge QA/security and evidence cover the integrated migration. Each child is verified against that same merged tree. An adopter migration note covers changed public UI types/localization and third-party compatibility where needed.\n\n## Scope issues\n\n- [ ] #1226 (epic:docs)\n- [ ] #1227 (epic:testing)\n- [ ] #1228 (epic:design-system)\n- [ ] #1229 (epic:core-di)\n- [ ] #1230 (epic:i18n)\n- [ ] #1231 (epic:core-foundation)\n- [ ] #1232 (epic:core-routing)\n- [ ] #1233 (epic:app-shell)\n- [ ] #1234 (epic:feature-auth)\n- [ ] #1235 (epic:feature-flags)\n- [ ] #1236 (epic:feature-tasks)\n",
